- Use a dedicated secrets manager (AWS Secrets Manager, HashiCorp Vault, Azure Key Vault)
- Implement secret caching with TTL to reduce API calls
- Rotate secrets regularly (automated)
- Use IAM roles for authentication instead of access keys
- Log secret access (but never log the secret values)
- Use different secrets for different environments

